    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/6a8ac5e7bac1e9068dbf82d060bdb131.poster.avif?t=1755389901\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/6a8ac5e7bac1e9068dbf82d060bdb131.webm?t=1755389901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/6a8ac5e7bac1e9068dbf82d060bdb131.mp4?t=1755389901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your train grow from a tiny engine to a screen-clearing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/71710c324352e96356af6056d03639a2.poster.avif?t=1755389901\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/71710c324352e96356af6056d03639a2.webm?t=1755389901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/71710c324352e96356af6056d03639a2.mp4?t=1755389901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cars and discover game-changing synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/1c606d2d6e0b4108967d6b9cb156db67.poster.avif?t=1755389901\" width=640 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/1c606d2d6e0b4108967d6b9cb156db67.webm?t=17553