" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/1c606d2d6e0b4108967d6b9cb156db67.mp4?t=1755389901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the upgrade skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208560/extras/2db07a80c8b12184fe050422a6bd157b.avif?t=1755389901\" width=640 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
